              "audioStart": 54.225,
              "audioEnd": 57.7
            },
            {
              "text": "She shook the tree until all the fruit was on the ground, and then she continued her journey.",
              "audioStart": 58.562,
              "audioEnd": 63.062
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "sentences": [
            {
              "text": "Soon, she reached a small house where an old woman lived.",
              "audioStart": 63.925,
              "audioEnd": 67
            },
            {
              "text": "The old woman, who was Mother Holle, told the girl to stay with her and make her bed.",
              "audioStart": 67.862,
              "audioEnd": 72.25
            },
            {
              "text": "Whenever she shook the bed properly, snow fell down upon the earth, which made the girl happy.",
              "audioStart": 73.112,
              "audioEnd": 77.925
            },
            {
              "text": "After spending some time there, she wanted to go home because she missed her family.",
              "audioStart": 78.787,
              "audioEnd": 83.075
            },
            {
              "text": "Mother Holle brought her to a large door, and as she passed through, a huge amount of gold fell down upon her.",
              "audioStart": 83.938,
              "audioEnd": 89.8
            },
            {
              "text": "She returned to her mother, covered in gold, and told them everything that had happened.",
              "audioStart": 90.662,
              "audioEnd": 95.062
            },
            {
              "text": "When the lazy girl saw the gold, she wanted to get rich too, so she jumped into the well on purpose.",
              "audioStart": 95.925,
              "audioEnd": 101.188
            },
            {
              "text": "She woke up in the same wonderful field, but she refused to help the bread and the tree.",
              "audioStart": 102.05,
              "audioEnd": 106.45
            },
            {
              "text": "When she arrived at Mother Holle's house, she was very lazy and refused to work hard.",
              "audioStart": 107.312,
              "audioEnd": 111.938
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "sentences": [
            {
              "text": "Mother Holle finally sent her away.",
              "audioStart": 112.8,
              "audioEnd": 114.75
            },
            {
              "text": "As she passed through the big door, a huge amount of dark material covered her completely.",
              "audioStart": 115.612,
              "audioEnd": 120.4
            },
            {
              "text": "She returned home with the material stuck to her, which served as a lesson for her bad behavior.",
              "audioStart": 121.263,
              "audioEnd": 126.125
            },
            {
              "text": "The lazy girl never forgot that day, and the good girl lived a happy life.",
              "audioStart": 126.987,
              "audioEnd": 131.1
            },
            {
              "text": "Many people in the town talked about this strange story for a long time.",
              "audioStart": 131.963,
              "audioEnd": 135.637
            },
            {
              "text": "They always remembered how the kind girl received a great reward for her wonderful service.",
              "audioStart": 136.5,
              "audioEnd": 140.975
            },
            {
              "text": "The mother finally understood that being good and doing work brings good things into life.",
              "audioStart": 141.838,
              "audioEnd": 146.325
            },
            {
              "text": "Even though the lazy girl tried to change her mind later, it was too late.",
              "audioStart": 147.188,
              "audioEnd": 151.037
            },
            {
              "text": "Every child in the neighborhood learned a very important lesson from the two girls.",
              "audioStart": 151.9,
              "audioEnd": 155.738
            },
            {
              "text": "They knew that truth and effort would always lead to success in the end.",
              "audioStart": 156.6,
              "audioEnd": 159.875
            },
            {
              "text": "The village remained a quiet place where everyone helped each other through difficult times.",
              "audioStart": 160.738,
              "audioEnd": 164.912
            },
            {
              "text": "Mother Holle continued to watch over the young people from her secret home above the clouds.",
              "audioStart": 165.775,
              "audioEnd": 170.175
            },
            {
              "text": "The sun kept shining upon the green field, and the special bread remained warm in the kitchen machine.",
              "audioStart": 171.037,
              "audioEnd": 176.287
            },
            {
              "text": "Life went on smoothly, and people always smiled when they thought about the special journey.",
              "audioStart": 177.15,
              "audioEnd": 181.625
            },
            {
              "text": "The community grew strong because the children learned how to be kind.",
              "audioStart": 182.488,
              "audioEnd": 185.787
            },
            {
              "text": "Every single person remembered the story of the good girl and her reward.",
              "audioStart": 186.65,
              "audioEnd": 190.162
            },
            {
              "text": "The mother changed her mind and began to treat both children with care.",
              "audioStart": 191.025,
              "audioEnd": 194.613
            },
            {
              "text": "No one ever forgot the important lessons of that wonderful summer.",
              "audioStart": 195.475,
              "audioEnd": 198.738
            },
            {
              "text": "People talked about the magical well for many years.",
              "audioStart": 199.6,
              "audioEnd": 202.387
            },
            {
              "text": "Children played near the water and listened to stories about Mother Holle.",
              "audioStart": 203.25,
              "audioEnd": 206.65
            },
            {
              "text": "The village became a symbol of peace and hard work.",
              "audioStart": 207.512,
              "audioEnd": 210.062
            },
            {
              "text": "Every family shared food and helped each other during difficult months.",
              "audioStart": 210.925,
              "audioEnd": 214.438
            },
            {
              "text": "The sun shone brightly every morning, bringing light and hope to the entire area.",
              "audioStart": 215.3,
              "audioEnd": 219.675
            },
            {
              "text": "Life in the small town was peaceful and full of joy.",
              "audioStart": 220.537,
              "audioEnd": 223.275
            },
            {
              "text": "Everyone knew that being good would always bring a happy future.",
              "audioStart": 224.137,
              "audioEnd": 227.213
            }
          ]
